1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,071
There is one last threshold.

2
00:00:02,118 --> 00:00:03,592
Before you cross it,

3
00:00:03,639 --> 00:00:05,082
you have to put down

4
00:00:05,129 --> 00:00:06,573
the story of the old

5
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,125
version of yourself.

6
00:00:08,173 --> 00:00:09,804
Not tomorrow. Not when

7
00:00:09,851 --> 00:00:11,404
you feel ready. Right

8
00:00:11,451 --> 00:00:12,878
now, as preparation

9
00:00:12,925 --> 00:00:14,322
for the final step.
